estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "The single-entity degradation ladder steps standard to brief before omission and the receipt records the applied depth and the reason; The refusal receipt reports the omitted result's estimated tokens, never the receipt's own size; A probe over every active item returns exit 0 at the default budget, with a negative control for an item whose brief projection also exceeds the ceiling; A spec reproduces pm-5t33or's shape: 26 dependencies and a 2,700-character description under the default budget"
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
expected_result: A single-entity read whose standard projection exceeds the ceiling degrades to the declared brief projection and reports the applied depth; the receipt's estimated_tokens names the omitted result's size.
actual_result: "pm get pm-5t33or --json exits 2 requested_budget_infeasible with estimated_tokens 177 while --depth brief, --depth deep, TOON and --output-budget 20000 all succeed."
